next: PR #33 (fix/medmc-alpha-spinner, hides the numericInput spin arrows on medmc's Significance Level field) open against dev, awaiting merge. Part 2 of the ADHD-friendly UX plan (medci/medmc broader validation + plot visual-hierarchy review, see /Users/dt/.claude/plans/abstract-weaving-boot.md) not started. medci UI enhancement items #9 (interactive plotly density plot) and #10 (bookmarkable state) are parked -- both cross the golem escalation trigger (CLAUDE.md), bigger scope than the single-file quick/medium wins already shipped. Dark-mode toggle also parked (see apps/medci/README.md Follow-up -- needs a CSS-custom-properties rework first, custom layout classes use hardcoded hex). No third app currently planned.
done: 2026-08-04 -- both medci and medmc are LIVE on Connect Cloud (connect.posit.cloud), verified working. medci: root cause of 3 failed deploy attempts was Connect Cloud's native GitHub-connect flow cloning the raw repo tree directly (not an rsconnect bundle) with no renv support at all -- .Rprofile/renv/ removed entirely (PRs #11-16). Shipped UI modernization in three rounds (quick wins #1-5, medium wins #6-8, copy/download controls) plus a debounce fix for live-reactivity error-flashing, then a follow-up fix (adversarial review caught it) for a case where the plot output hadn't actually inherited the debounce and medci() was being computed twice per settle. medmc: migrated per SPEC-medmc-migration-2026-08-04.md -- not a straight port, since current RMediation::ci() is an S7 generic with no equivalent for the original's arbitrary-formula calling pattern. Reimplemented Monte Carlo + Asymptotic-Delta CI computation directly in the app, verified against the actual RMediation 1.1.3 source (contemporary with the 2014 original) after an adversarial spec review caught a point-estimate assumption error before implementation. Added a live matrix sanity-check swatch (PR #32) next to medmc's Variance-Covariance Matrix input -- renderUI CSS grid + magnitude-scaled PSD check, sourced from the existing parseSigma() reactive so it inherits validation and stays independent of the debounced results(); plan adversarially reviewed before implementation (abstract-weaving-boot.md).
